	(text_box "bootstrap capacitor was calulated using Qg/VoltageDrop\nQg was taken from datasheet and a small voltage drop of .5 was assumed. which gave a value of 2.68nF. As a rule of thumb the value of the minimum capacitoance(2.68nF) was increase about 10 times which gives 2.7uF\n "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.855 39.37 0)
		(size 38.735 20.955)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
